{"data":{"body":"**P1:** This fallback only runs when `_notify_parent_of_terminal_child()` is invoked. Startup does not redrive persisted terminal children, so a child that completed before the previous process exited, or whose notification was lost, leaves its parent STARTED forever. Reconcile terminal children and pending parent links during executor startup, or persist a notification outbox, and test an actual stop/start without manually invoking this private method.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7weq7V","finding_digest":"37e024583fa24dc83171a92690d19d6ec04a473f6ff95d054e9e080bd309dfa8","finding_id":"arf_v1_g7qciwb7ujg4qmlrvetjbum5n3","finding_key":"testing/executor.py::_notify_parent_of_terminal_child::persistent-link-recovery","identity_key":"testing/executor.py::_notify_parent_of_terminal_child::persistent-link-recovery","line":1851,"observation_digest":"5b5582c60523d8d7ebcad3e651e107fe084dce5f1003afecf1a884b27adffd0c","observation_id":"aro_v1_lnkyfrqfepmnp26k2ptfdyih7y","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-testing/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_testing/executor.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_g7qciwb7ujg4qmlrvetjbum5n3","published_at":"2026-09-17T08:11:07Z","review_id":"arr_v1_3bvcew2vfedcjt5bvjy2l7kotx","reviewed_base_sha":"cf4d27f59c2bf14f87c3ef75f58fc0881b2e2c34","reviewed_head_sha":"7f5a1277cabc95bdaf6569c272003069e50f6458","reviewer":"codex","start_line":1850,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":731},"record_id":"art_v1_dfmafwbwrvhl73xjwwugnsjrzy","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-17T08:11:07Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
